WEBVTT

01:24.100 --> 01:29.980
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

01:58.700 --> 02:01.840
<i>This Ranger's quick on his feet.</i>

02:01.840 --> 02:03.290
<i>But not quick enough!</i>

02:37.130 --> 02:39.000
I can't go down here...

02:39.440 --> 02:41.510
Too bad for you.

02:45.230 --> 02:48.000
I won't let you transform.

02:56.880 --> 02:58.600
<i>Oh, great.</i>

02:58.600 --> 03:02.620
<i>I wound up chasing him right into the zoo.</i>

03:05.030 --> 03:08.510
Listen, it's dangerous here.
You need to get away.

03:08.510 --> 03:09.990
Where's my mom?

03:09.990 --> 03:10.690
Huh?

03:10.690 --> 03:12.930
I can't find her.

03:12.930 --> 03:14.440
<i>He's lost.</i>

03:23.620 --> 03:25.170
Stay away from him!

03:25.460 --> 03:27.660
Children are Earth's future!

03:27.660 --> 03:28.940
I won't let you harm them!

03:29.290 --> 03:30.540
Oh?

03:43.860 --> 03:47.610
<i>Attention all visitors,
we have a lost child report.</i>

03:48.250 --> 03:54.270
<i>Keitaro is wearing a striped shirt 
and carrying a stuffed panda.</i>

03:54.270 --> 03:56.070
<i>His mother is looking for him.</i>

03:56.720 --> 04:01.210
<i>If you know of his whereabouts, 
please notify the nearest employee.</i>

04:03.990 --> 04:06.110
Are you Keitaro?

04:06.850 --> 04:07.800
I'm Kei.

04:08.240 --> 04:11.060
I like pandas.

04:11.060 --> 04:14.470
Yeah? I like pandas, too.

04:14.470 --> 04:16.450
They said your mom's looking for you.

04:16.450 --> 04:18.120
You'll see her soon!

04:20.070 --> 04:22.130
Don't worry. Come with me and—

04:21.270 --> 04:24.580
For the lost children center,
go straight and then take a right.

04:28.660 --> 04:30.610
Now get moving.

04:30.610 --> 04:33.460
For the love of pandas, I'll stand down.

04:34.080 --> 04:36.830
But it won't happen again.

04:38.830 --> 04:40.550
Fine by me.

05:04.520 --> 05:06.180
Something came up.

05:06.180 --> 05:08.400
I wasn't able to complete my mission.

05:08.400 --> 05:10.290
<i>Oh, that's too bad.</i>

05:10.290 --> 05:11.740
I'm on my way back.

05:11.740 --> 05:14.850
<i>Huh? But it's nearly quitting time.</i>

05:14.850 --> 05:16.870
<i>Just call it a day.</i>

05:16.870 --> 05:17.840
No.

05:17.840 --> 05:19.230
<i>Okay, keep up the good work!</i>

05:19.230 --> 05:20.030
Hey.

05:24.460 --> 05:26.480
I still have time.

05:27.550 --> 05:30.390
New panda merch!

05:27.550 --> 05:30.390
Panda cookies:
the gift everyone loves!

05:30.390 --> 05:32.720
Shoebill

05:30.390 --> 05:32.720
Elephant

05:30.390 --> 05:32.720
Hippopotamus

05:35.100 --> 05:39.100
<b>Big Stuffed Animals</b>

05:39.370 --> 05:44.670
<i>It's a universal truth that the creatures
 called pandas are charming.</i>

05:45.220 --> 05:49.990
<i>But things made in their image 
are also, in turn, charming.</i>

05:52.620 --> 05:56.580
<i>It's only natural that things resembling
 the real deal are cute.</i>

05:56.580 --> 06:00.600
<i>But caricatures possess 
a charm all their own.</i>

06:03.730 --> 06:07.380
<i>That being the case, 
I must prize the way they feel!</i>

06:11.310 --> 06:14.010
<i>Aha, this fur is on the stiff side.</i>

06:17.730 --> 06:20.980
Rather than soft, it feels substantial.

06:20.980 --> 06:22.270
That's pretty good.

06:23.390 --> 06:26.020
Now for the caricatured one.

06:27.320 --> 06:28.820
<b>sqwoosh</b>

06:34.650 --> 06:36.020
<i>What is this?</i>

06:34.660 --> 06:40.670
<b>skoosh</b>

06:34.660 --> 06:40.670
<b>skoosh</b>

06:36.020 --> 06:39.860
<i>This softness that tickles the skin?</i>

06:40.650 --> 06:45.610
<i>It makes me... want to 
keep touching it forever!</i>

06:55.680 --> 06:57.470
<i>How can this be?</i>

06:57.470 --> 07:00.160
<i>Now I'm unable to put it down.</i>

07:00.160 --> 07:02.610
<i>I have no choice but to buy it!</i>

07:21.670 --> 07:23.580
<b><i>TA-DA</i></b>

07:24.140 --> 07:25.670
Are these gifts for someone?

07:25.670 --> 07:27.350
They're for me.

07:30.990 --> 07:35.650
<i>We're so grateful you came to our zoo today.</i>

07:36.250 --> 07:38.710
<i>We look forward to your next visit.</i>

07:45.980 --> 07:51.990
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

07:45.980 --> 07:51.990
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

08:06.630 --> 08:08.620
Why not head on home?

08:10.170 --> 08:12.610
I'm not done with work yet.

08:12.610 --> 08:15.350
Yeah, that exec meeting did run long.

08:15.350 --> 08:16.920
Oh, that reminds me.

08:16.920 --> 08:19.400
You know those creatures you like, General?

08:19.400 --> 08:20.900
They're pandas.

08:20.900 --> 08:26.260
Yeah, pandas. Don't they have three 
habitats within our territory?

08:26.260 --> 08:29.030
Except I heard there might be another.

08:29.410 --> 08:31.500
What did you just say?

08:32.790 --> 08:37.700
To be precise, there are apparently 
panda-like <i>things</i> there.

08:37.700 --> 08:40.000
And where is this?

08:40.440 --> 08:43.660
Well, you see, right here.

08:44.460 --> 08:47.750
If there really are pandas there...

08:48.580 --> 08:50.920
I'll go see them with my own eyes!

08:50.920 --> 08:53.210
Just you wait, pandas!

08:56.400 --> 08:58.610
Uh, you should get some rest...

09:13.240 --> 09:17.240
<b>Toyokan</b>

09:29.170 --> 09:32.760
Asakusa Gate

09:30.150 --> 09:32.760
Asakusa Hanayashiki

09:35.800 --> 09:37.680
I arrived too early.

09:38.510 --> 09:39.390
<b>Regular Mail</b>

09:38.510 --> 09:39.390
<b>Non-Standard Sizes</b>

09:51.370 --> 09:53.150
Might as well get in line.

09:55.530 --> 09:59.530
Asakusa Gate

09:57.360 --> 09:59.530
<b>Exit</b>

09:57.360 --> 09:59.530
<b>Enter</b>

10:18.370 --> 10:20.650
<i>Where are the pandas?</i>

10:21.400 --> 10:24.890
<i>This doesn't look like a place 
that would have pandas.</i>

10:24.890 --> 10:26.690
<i>Oh, Rooney...</i>

10:26.690 --> 10:30.970
<i>I hope you weren't just 
half-asleep and seeing things.</i>

10:32.010 --> 10:34.280
<i>Might as well investigate anyway.</i>

10:34.280 --> 10:35.830
Let's hurry!

10:35.830 --> 10:38.780
The rides will be there
whether we hurry or not.

10:38.780 --> 10:43.040
But since we're here, it'd be a waste 
if we didn't ride lots of them!

10:43.040 --> 10:45.310
Then why don't we get free passes?

10:45.310 --> 10:46.280
Let's!

10:49.120 --> 10:50.440
Come on!

10:51.310 --> 10:56.410
Is riding the rides what people do here?

10:56.410 --> 10:59.660
My ultimate goal is to find the pandas.

10:59.660 --> 11:03.140
But it wouldn't be good to make 
the Earthlings suspicious.

11:05.920 --> 11:08.640
One adult free pass.

11:08.640 --> 11:09.640
Again!

11:09.640 --> 11:11.690
Let's get on the merry-go-round again!

11:11.690 --> 11:14.190
Again? How about something else?

11:14.190 --> 11:17.940
No! I wanna ride Mr. Horsey again!

11:17.100 --> 11:19.430
<i>They have a horsey here?</i>

11:17.940 --> 11:20.970
Mr. Horsey is my favorite!

11:19.430 --> 11:22.200
<i>In that case, maybe there are pandas.</i>

11:20.970 --> 11:23.270
Can't I ride him one more time?!

11:29.410 --> 11:36.860
<b>Boarding
Zone</b>

11:32.210 --> 11:34.870
I guess I'll try riding Mr. Horsey.

12:12.580 --> 12:14.120
<i>Again?</i>

12:14.120 --> 12:17.930
<i>Why do the Earthlings wave at me?</i>

12:18.170 --> 12:20.670
Haunted House

12:20.670 --> 12:32.480
Haunted House

13:08.630 --> 13:12.160
<i>What sort of training 
is this supposed to be?</i>

13:12.160 --> 13:14.400
<i>The pandas are nowhere to be found!</i>

13:18.230 --> 13:21.400
Exit

13:20.920 --> 13:22.560
That was so much fun!

13:21.880 --> 13:26.490
Exit

13:22.560 --> 13:23.740
Let's ride it again!

13:23.740 --> 13:24.470
Yeah!

13:36.180 --> 13:39.370
Always be wary of Earthlings.

13:39.370 --> 13:41.640
Letting children ride these things...

13:41.640 --> 13:44.900
This had better not be some 
Ranger training facility!

13:45.510 --> 13:48.080
What <i>is</i> this place?

13:54.790 --> 13:59.210
Is it your first time here, mister?

13:59.520 --> 14:01.520
<b><i>Roller Coaster</i></b>

14:02.440 --> 14:06.770
Amusement parks are where
 everyone can be a child.

14:07.580 --> 14:11.970
You know, I come here from time to time.

14:12.790 --> 14:15.580
Not that I can handle any of the rides.

14:16.150 --> 14:19.320
See, take a look.

14:21.830 --> 14:25.780
The place is overflowing 
with smiles and happiness.

14:26.420 --> 14:30.080
It's a space far removed from everyday life.

14:30.080 --> 14:34.370
Oddly enough, it makes 
everyone a bit childlike.

14:35.230 --> 14:40.970
When I come here and watch people 
enjoying their all-too-brief days off,

14:41.720 --> 14:45.360
it really takes me back.

14:46.920 --> 14:48.450
Hey, did you know?

14:49.210 --> 14:51.680
They have pandas here!

14:51.680 --> 14:54.620
I love riding them!

14:57.870 --> 14:59.640
Grandpa!

15:03.450 --> 15:05.040
Hey, let's go over there!

15:05.330 --> 15:07.390
What was that all about?

15:09.000 --> 15:13.640
<i>Apparently amusement parks </i>aren't<i>
Ranger training facilities.</i>

15:13.640 --> 15:17.520
<i>I should have asked him 
where the pandas are.</i>

15:22.810 --> 15:25.820
<b>Kids Ninja Park</b>

15:25.820 --> 15:28.820
<b>Souvenir Shop Hanamaru</b>

15:28.820 --> 15:31.780
<b>Souvenirs</b>

15:33.520 --> 15:37.950
<i>Panda snacks and stationery.</i>

15:37.950 --> 15:40.400
<i>Panda badges and stickers.</i>

15:40.400 --> 15:44.840
<i>What's with this comprehensive 
line-up of panda goods?!</i>

15:46.980 --> 15:49.430
This is a panda tail?

15:49.430 --> 15:54.310
Are the pandas that live here a 
new species with black tails?

15:58.340 --> 16:00.360
What's the meaning of this?!

16:00.360 --> 16:05.240
Pandas imprisoned inside tiny capsules?!

16:05.240 --> 16:09.080
Curse your evildoing, Earthlings!

16:09.080 --> 16:11.940
But never fear, pandas!

16:11.940 --> 16:14.690
I shall swiftly come to your aid!

16:15.810 --> 16:17.660
No panda left behind!

16:18.170 --> 16:20.650
All of you!

16:24.670 --> 16:27.670
<b>Pandas!</b>

16:28.970 --> 16:31.500
Now you are free.

16:31.500 --> 16:34.940
But why are you nearly all identical?

16:35.390 --> 16:37.430
So long as you're cute.

16:37.430 --> 16:41.800
Oh, right. I must hurry and find 
the black-tailed pandas.

16:42.760 --> 16:43.970
<i>Where are they?</i>

16:44.930 --> 16:47.140
<i>Where are you, pandas?</i>

16:47.690 --> 16:50.430
<i>I will find you, no matter what!</i>

16:53.880 --> 16:55.260
<i>Pandas...</i>

16:55.260 --> 16:59.090
<i>Where could you and your black tails be?</i>

16:59.090 --> 17:01.310
Pardon me, sir.

17:02.890 --> 17:04.940
Is something troubling you?

17:05.740 --> 17:07.950
I'm looking for the pandas.

17:08.280 --> 17:09.890
The pandas?

17:09.890 --> 17:12.190
Oh, of course!

17:12.190 --> 17:13.960
I'll show you the way.

17:24.900 --> 17:31.290
<i>The black-tailed pandas are hidden 
beyond this narrow passage?</i>

17:38.520 --> 17:41.490
This is where you get on the panda cars.

17:45.540 --> 17:47.240
What the?!

17:48.220 --> 17:50.110
What are these?

17:50.110 --> 17:51.450
Pandas?

17:51.450 --> 17:52.970
These are pandas?

17:52.970 --> 17:55.250
There's even a cub!

17:55.250 --> 17:59.980
You mean... these pandas let 
you ride on their backs?

18:29.940 --> 18:33.210
Oh, so they're a ride.

18:33.600 --> 18:38.990
Yes. Earth has many wonders 
not found on our home planet.

18:38.990 --> 18:41.540
Further investigation is required.

18:42.800 --> 18:43.980
What's this?

18:43.980 --> 18:45.320
A panda car.

18:45.320 --> 18:47.470
It has a black tail.

18:47.470 --> 18:51.930
Yeah. But real pandas have white tails.

18:51.930 --> 18:55.910
So why do the panda cars have black ones?

18:55.910 --> 19:00.250
Beats me. I have no idea what 
goes through the Earthlings' heads.

19:01.580 --> 19:03.380
It's cute, though.

19:04.080 --> 19:06.450
You got that right.

19:12.000 --> 19:18.010
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

19:12.000 --> 19:18.010
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

19:22.230 --> 19:26.990
<i>I've already visited this 
Earth zoo dozens of times.</i>

19:27.400 --> 19:32.590
<i>Lately, I've mainly been observing 
the differences in the panda's faces.</i>

19:32.480 --> 19:33.980
<b>Annual pass
holder</b>

19:49.240 --> 19:52.860
<i>This female panda has graceful features.</i>

19:52.860 --> 19:56.010
<i>And this male over here...</i>

20:00.580 --> 20:03.550
<i>has almond-shaped eyes and angular features.</i>

20:03.550 --> 20:05.260
<i>He looks dignified.</i>

20:05.260 --> 20:08.600
<i>Yes, he's a handsome one in the panda world.</i>

20:09.000 --> 20:12.810
<i>But he reminds me of someone...</i>

20:12.810 --> 20:14.280
<i>Especially those eyes.</i>

20:21.620 --> 20:24.770
<i>He looks vaguely like my coworker Trigger.</i>

20:24.770 --> 20:27.030
<i>I think... No!</i>

20:27.440 --> 20:32.360
<i>Being reminded of colleagues 
on my day off violates my creed!</i>

20:31.960 --> 20:36.710
His creed:
Disconnect 
from work
on days off

20:32.360 --> 20:36.360
<i>My creed? Disconnect from work on days off.</i>

20:46.170 --> 20:49.370
Once again, I have outdone my best shot.

20:49.890 --> 20:52.870
<i>All thoughts of coworkers 
quickly fled my mind.</i>

20:53.440 --> 20:58.440
<b>Back to work</b>

20:59.370 --> 21:00.430
Ugh!

21:00.770 --> 21:03.860
<i>That's the last mug I wanted to see.</i>

21:08.160 --> 21:10.490
What, got nothin' to say?

21:12.160 --> 21:15.460
Don't just stand there in my way!

21:15.960 --> 21:17.460
Are you listening?!

21:17.930 --> 21:19.380
Hey!

21:31.310 --> 21:34.480
The hell're you laughin' at?!

21:35.100 --> 21:36.580
Sir!

21:36.580 --> 21:38.070
Please calm down!

21:38.070 --> 21:40.050
T-Trigger, sir!

21:40.050 --> 21:49.940
Whoa, whoa...

21:42.100 --> 21:44.850
You'll pay for this, you creep!

21:46.630 --> 21:49.680
I swear I'll reduce you to tears.

23:20.000 --> 23:20.710
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

23:20.000 --> 23:20.710
<b>MR. VILLAIN'S DAY OFF</b>

23:22.200 --> 23:24.500
Tidings from Valencia.

23:25.590 --> 23:27.240
The navel bulge.

23:28.890 --> 23:30.990
A mandarin smile.

23:32.390 --> 23:34.310
The lovely tangor.

23:34.790 --> 23:36.540
The captivating tangerine.

23:38.010 --> 23:39.520
Eyes of marmalade.

23:41.750 --> 23:44.410
The melody of an incomplete symphony.

23:45.150 --> 23:48.290
Gifts in the season of white.

23:48.650 --> 23:49.940
Gifts in the Season of White
